  "type": "mol",
  "smiles": "COc1cccc(NC(=O)c2nnn(Cc3ccc(CN4CC(F)C4)cc3)c2N)c1",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "reaction",
      "template_id": 82466,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "COc1cccc(NC(=O)c2nn[nH]c2N)c1"
        },
        {
          "type": "mol",
          "smiles": "FC1CN(Cc2ccc(CBr)cc2)C1"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

Both precursors are commercially available, and the total cost is within the budget. The route consists of a single retrosynthetic step, making it efficient and cost-effective. 

